<Base title="Refund policy" description="Refunds for the $49 Industry spotlight (full refund before it goes live or within the first 7 days) and the done-for-you setup guarantee: a full refund of our fee if the agreed result is not reached by day 60.">
  <article class="wrap prose page-intro legal">
    <h1>Refund policy</h1>
    <p class="note">Last updated: November 13, 2026</p>

    <h2 id="spotlight">Industry spotlight ($49)</h2>
    <p>The <a href="/get-featured/">Industry spotlight</a> puts you in the top spot on one industry page for 30 days, labeled Sponsored. There is no contract. You pay once through a Stripe Payment Link.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Before it goes live:</strong> full refund, any time.</li>
      <li><strong>First 7 days after it goes live:</strong> if you're not happy, full refund, no questions asked.</li>
      <li><strong>After day 7:</strong> no partial refunds. The spotlight runs its full 30 days.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The spotlight does not renew automatically. It is a one-time payment.</p>

    <h2 id="how">How to ask for a refund</h2>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:timothy@aiphonecompare.com?subject=Refund">timothy@aiphonecompare.com</a> from the address you paid with. The refund goes back to your original card through Stripe. It usually takes 5–10 business days to show up, depending on your bank.</p>

    <h2 id="removal">If we remove a spotlight</h2>
    <p>We may remove a spotlight that is misleading. If we do, we refund it in full.</p>

    <h2 id="done-for-you">Done-for-you setup guarantee</h2>
    <p>The <a href="/done-for-you/">done-for-you setup</a> is $1,500, paid once ($1,000 founding rate for the first 5 businesses). You pay through a Stripe Payment Link. Before we start, we agree on a result, and we measure it from your own records.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Baseline:</strong> the 14 days before go-live, from your phone system's call log: inbound calls during covered hours, how many were captured (answered, booked, transferred, or a usable message with caller name, reason and callback number), and appointments booked by phone.</li>
      <li><strong>Measurement window:</strong> days 31–60 after go-live, same hours and same sources.</li>
      <li><strong>Result:</strong> either at least 90% of inbound calls in covered hours are captured, or phone-booked appointments are at least 15% higher per week than the baseline weekly average.</li>
      <li><strong>Guarantee:</strong> if neither result is reached by day 60, you get a full refund of our fee ($1,500, or $1,000 at the founding rate).</li>
      <li><strong>Conditions:</strong> the receptionist stays live and calls are forwarded as set up for the 60 days, and you share the call log and booking counts for both windows.</li>
      <li><strong>Vendor fees:</strong> the AI receptionist subscription is paid to the vendor and falls under the vendor's terms, not this refund.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>How to claim:</strong> email <a href="mailto:timothy@aiphonecompare.com?subject=Done-for-you%20refund">timothy@aiphonecompare.com</a> after day 60. The refund goes back to your original card through Stripe. It usually takes 5–10 business days to show up, depending on your bank.</p>

    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about refunds: <a href="mailto:timothy@aiphonecompare.com">timothy@aiphonecompare.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
